@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Pembayaran Dibatalkan";
}

<style>
    .result-page {
        min-height: calc(100vh - 60px - 72px);
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        padding: 40px 24px;
    }

    .result-card {
        background: var(--card);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 16px;
        max-width: 480px;
        width: 100%;
        overflow: hidden;
    }

    .result-card-top {
        background: rgba(239,68,68,.05);
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(239,68,68,.15);
        padding: 32px 36px;
        text-align: center;
    }

    .cancel-icon {
        width: 56px; height: 56px;
        background: rgba(239,68,68,.1);
        border: 2px solid rgba(239,68,68,.25);
        border-radius: 50%;
        display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
        margin: 0 auto 16px;
    }

    .cancel-icon svg { width: 26px; height: 26px; stroke: #ef4444; fill: none; stroke-width: 2.5; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; }

    .result-card-top h2 { font-size: 1.4rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 6px; }
    .result-card-top p { color: #9ca3af; font-size: .9rem; margin: 0; }

    .result-card-body { padding: 28px 36px; text-align: center; }
    .result-card-body p { font-size: .9rem; color: #9ca3af; margin-bottom: 24px; }
</style>

<div class="result-page">
    <div class="result-card">
        <div class="result-card-top">
            <div class="cancel-icon">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"/><line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h2>Pembayaran Dibatalkan</h2>
            <p>Tiada caj dikenakan ke atas akaun anda.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="result-card-body">
            <p>Proses pembayaran tidak diselesaikan. Anda boleh cuba semula pada bila-bila masa.</p>
            <div style="display:flex; gap:12px; justify-content:center; flex-wrap:wrap;">
                <a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Pricing" class="btn-primary">Cuba Semula</a>
                <a href="https://wa.me/60195778954?text=Hai%20EZPos%2C%20saya%20ada%20masalah%20semasa%20pembayaran." class="btn-outline" target="_blank">Hubungi Kami</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
